# amendment 2 2026-11-15 (buttons-kit.mjs + buttons-busy-discover.mjs), found on the after-fix run: the busy rule says "exactly one camera open" but counted EVERY getUserMedia call; interview.html opens the microphone and the camera as two separate requests by design (a slow microphone must not block the camera), so one tap counted 2 and no page could pass. Now: camera requests (getUserMedia with video) must be exactly 1 as before, and microphone-only requests are counted separately and must be at most 1 (new check, stricter than before for audio). Timings, busy / disabled check, entries and every other rule unchanged.
